{"unit_id":"xindong__dsh-client-canvas#card-zh","repo":"xindong/dsh-client-canvas","commit":"2499ab42c076324360878c62178b3f0ac95a4a1e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@miragari/dsh-client-canvas（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：它在 DSH Web 中加入 Canvas 画布，把素材、节点关系和 Agent 对话放进同一工作区。它通过浏览器界面和本机 HTTP 桥接连接配套画布服务，支持图片、视频、音频、3D 模型、PDF、Office、文档及代码文件的查看与预览，也可在画布旁继续原生会话并对选中节点发起 Agent 操作。适合需要整理研究素材、连接过程与成果，并让 Agent 参考画布上下文的 DSH Web 用户。需要兼容的 DSH Web、Node.js 22.18 或更高版本；不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:502-529","lib/index.js:17-37"]}
{"unit_id":"xindong__dsh-client-canvas#card-en","repo":"xindong/dsh-client-canvas","commit":"2499ab42c076324360878c62178b3f0ac95a4a1e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@miragari/dsh-client-canvas (DSH Web plugin): adds a visual Canvas for organizing media, documents, code, and connected nodes. Preview files, keep DSH chat beside the canvas, and ask an agent to act on selected nodes. Requires compatible DSH Web and Node.js 22.18+; no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:502-529","lib/index.js:17-37"]}
