{"unit_id":"xindong__dsh-client-canvas#feature-1","repo":"xindong/dsh-client-canvas","commit":"2499ab42c076324360878c62178b3f0ac95a4a1e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@miragari/dsh-client-canvas 的功能「画布工作区」：在 DSH Web 的会话视图加入 Canvas Tab，显示可持续编辑的画布。用户可在画布中组织素材和节点；配套服务保存文档与资源。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:502-519","lib/index.js:195-222"]}
{"unit_id":"xindong__dsh-client-canvas#feature-2","repo":"xindong/dsh-client-canvas","commit":"2499ab42c076324360878c62178b3f0ac95a4a1e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@miragari/dsh-client-canvas 的功能「节点 Agent 操作」：用户从选中节点发出指令，插件把提示词送到当前 DSH 会话，并将结果回传画布界面。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:84-105","lib/client.js:17-20"]}
{"unit_id":"xindong__dsh-client-canvas#feature-3","repo":"xindong/dsh-client-canvas","commit":"2499ab42c076324360878c62178b3f0ac95a4a1e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@miragari/dsh-client-canvas 的功能「文件预览」：导入文档或模型后，后台预览服务生成可显示的预览；Office 文件使用宿主提供的转换服务，完成状态通过事件更新。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:142-187","lib/preview-service.js:985-1018"]}
{"unit_id":"xindong__dsh-client-canvas#feature-4","repo":"xindong/dsh-client-canvas","commit":"2499ab42c076324360878c62178b3f0ac95a4a1e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@miragari/dsh-client-canvas 的功能「媒体处理」：图片、视频和音频素材导入后由后台队列准备媒体信息与衍生资源，并将处理状态发布给画布节点。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/media-service.js:5-35","lib/media-service.js:70-105"]}
{"unit_id":"xindong__dsh-client-canvas#caveat-1","repo":"xindong/dsh-client-canvas","commit":"2499ab42c076324360878c62178b3f0ac95a4a1e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@miragari/dsh-client-canvas 使用前须知：Office 预览需要宿主提供 officeToPdf 服务，否则该类文件无法预览。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/preview-service.js:985-987"]}
